# CHIME CIRCUIT: THE DIPPER. The main line dives under the hanging rock
# (the dip) and climbs out again, and everyone flies it: the demo pilot
# and every CPU. The slot through the rock is a short, risky bypass: three
# tiles high with a two-tile step in the middle. Rushed through level at
# full speed, a ship hits the step; flown well, with a climb timed through
# the step, it comes out clean and a little ahead of the dip line.
seed 701
game chime
wait 30
cheat race 2
expect route0 == 0
expect route1 == 0
expect route2 == 0
expect route3 == 0
expect route4 == 0
expect route5 == 0
cheat park_cpus
cheat go
# the demo pilot's lap: down into the dip ...
botuntil laps0 == 1 2000
botuntil x0 <= 205 2000
botplay 30
expect y0 > 70
# ... and 80 frames on it is still short of checkpoint 1
botplay 50
expect cp0 == 1
botuntil cp0 == 2 100
expect walls0 == 0
# the slot rushed: level along its middle at full speed, into the step
cheat place 0 205 38
cheat vel 0 -560 0
cheat hp 0 3
cheat mercy 0 0
cheat cp 0 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
expect walls0 >= 1
expect hp0 == 2
# the slot flown well: in low and slower, a climb through the step,
# then a hover out: clean, and through checkpoint 1 within 70 frames
cheat place 0 205 44
cheat vel 0 -300 0
cheat hp 0 3
cheat mercy 0 0
cheat cp 0 1
cheat clear
expect walls0 == 1
hold LEFT+A 6
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 2
expect x0 < 120
waituntil cp0 == 2 22
expect hp0 == 3
expect walls0 == 1
